{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Queen\n💻 Full name: Serial Number Q5U4EX7YY2E9N. She is the tyrannical ruler of the Cyber World and main antagonist of Ch.2.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Berdly**\nHer ally (and victim) in Ch.2 — together they try to build a \"Smartopia,\" until she loses control over him and ends up forcibly subjugating him with a cable to the face.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Noelle**\nShe kidnaps her the moment she arrives in the Cyber World, trying to turn her into her \"willing pawn\" to expand her power.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Roaring Knight**\nHer obsession with creating her own Dark Fountain stems from watching him create his — he is, in a way, her role model until Ralsei explains to her what the Roaring really entails.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**King**\nThey call each other \"Queenie Beanie\" and \"Kingy Wingy\" when they reunite — one of the few genuinely affectionate bonds Queen has. According to Ramb, as children the two were toys in a doctor game between Kris and another girl.","x":-130,"y":480,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"1"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Rouxls Kaard**\nHe barely knows her in person: he tells the King he's sorry about Queen's \"new man,\" leaving both of them confused about who he means.","x":-680,"y":480,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"1"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Does her villainy come from the Dark Fountain?**\nIt's hinted, without conclusive proof, that the Dark Fountain itself may have intensified Queen's negative and aggressive traits — though it's unclear whether this excuses her actions or simply makes them worse.","x":-680,"y":220,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"3"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Berdly_battle_intro.gif","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":240,"height":134},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_overworld.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":90,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/TheRoaringKnightDeltarune.webp","x":420,"y":10,"width":158,"height":180},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/King_face.png","x":-130,"y":270,"width":149,"height":180},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Rouxls_Kaard_face.png","x":-680,"y":270,"width":172,"height":180},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Queen_deltarune.webp","x":-39,"y":-290,"width":98,"height":190},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/GIGA_Queen_battle.gif","x":-935,"y":435,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s5","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s5-img","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"}]}